    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVER WISHED FOR...</strong>\u00a0<strong><i>an</i>\u00a0<i>atmospheric</i></strong><i> System Shock 2 style\u00a0</i><strong>adventure -</strong> <i>blended\u00a0with</i>\u00a0<strong>FPS<i> action</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>and <i>Goldeneye style </i><strong>gunplay?\u00a0</strong>Light a <i>torch.\u00a0</i>Grab\u00a0your<i> shotgun. Prepare for a</i>\u00a0<strong>cursed adventure -\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930340/extras/fc6b9729d9d90437f7ce74a3133f6477.avif?t=1744372873\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Not all that glistens in the darkness is GOLD!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930340/extras/2d64759b94a3ddc0b40ec8a331568fe2.avif?t=1744372873\" data-has-big width=800 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE BACKSTORY</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare for an atmospheric single-player adventure as you steal a map from a gang of murderous bandits that leads to cursed gold buried in the depths and darkness of an ancient mine. This old-school-inspired first person shooter features -</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging combat against a variety of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted levels filled with dangerous environmental hazards to navigate and survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold to mine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sticks of dynamite to throw.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critters to squish, cursed bosses to fight and lots of weapons to shoot at the murderous gang of bandits hunting you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a love letter to the &quot;90's child&quot; living inside all of us old-time nerds.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE GAMEPLAY</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLUID COMBAT\u00a0</strong>will keep you on edge as you battle engaging &amp; reactive enemy AI while facing a variety of enemy types including: Bandits, critters of the mine, cursed enemies, environmental hazards, and <i>unique</i> <strong>BOSS FIGHT</strong> combat sequences!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SMART AI</strong> ensures the murderous bandits hunting you inside the mine eventually find you and provide a unique combat experience when least expected!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930340/extras/709e3f907fe551a3a9ca6d07f16c0459.poster.avif?t=1744372873\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930340/extras/709e3f907fe551a3a9ca6d07f16c0459.webm?t=1744372873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930340/extras/709e3f907fe551a3a9ca6d07f16c0459.mp4?t=1744372873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATMOSPHERIC ADVENTURE</strong><i>\u00a0through a single-player campaign spanning multiple chapters each containing dozens of unique hand-crafted levels.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930340/extras/177364db969e59da3e2c7485a6ddee08.avif?t=1744372873\" data-has-big width=800 height=140 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VOICE ACTED </strong>main character provides\u00a0<i>dynamic spoken dialog</i>\u00a0commenting on player actions and gameplay events.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BANDITS are also<strong> voice acted -</strong>\u00a0providing a more <i><u>personal connection</u></i>\u00a0as you battle your enemies.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DANGEROUS ENVIROMENTAL HAZARDS</strong>\u00a0are found around every corner inside a cursed gold mine that is trying to protect its gold by actively attempting to kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EVER WISHED FOR...</strong>\u00a0<strong><i>an</i>\u00a0<i>atmospheric</i></strong><i> System Shock 2 style\u00a0</i><strong>adventure -</strong> <i>blended\u00a0with</i>\u00a0<strong>FPS<i> action</i></strong><i>\u00a0</i>and <i>Goldeneye style </i><strong>gunplay?\u00a0</strong>Light a <i>torch.\u00a0</i>Grab\u00a0your<i> shotgun. Prepare for a</i>\u00a0<strong>cursed adventure -\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930340/extras/fc6b9729d9d90437f7ce74a3133f6477.avif?t=1744372873\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Not all that glistens in the darkness is GOLD!</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930340/extras/2d64759b94a3ddc0b40ec8a331568fe2.avif?t=1744372873\" data-has-big width=800 height=438 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE BACKSTORY</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prepare for an atmospheric single-player adventure as you steal a map from a gang of murderous bandits that leads to cursed gold buried in the depths and darkness of an ancient mine. This old-school-inspired first person shooter features -</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging combat against a variety of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted levels filled with dangerous environmental hazards to navigate and survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold to mine.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sticks of dynamite to throw.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Critters to squish, cursed bosses to fight and lots of weapons to shoot at the murderous gang of bandits hunting you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a love letter to the &quot;90's child&quot; living inside all of us old-time nerds.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>THE GAMEPLAY</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FLUID COMBAT\u00a0</strong>will keep you on edge as you battle engaging &amp; reactive enemy AI while facing a variety of enemy types including: Bandits, critters of the mine, cursed enemies, environmental hazards, and <i>unique</i> <strong>BOSS FIGHT</strong> combat sequences!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SMART AI</strong> ensures the murderous bandits hunting you inside the mine eventually find you and provide a unique combat experience when least expected!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930340/extras/709e3f907fe551a3a9ca6d07f16c0459.poster.avif?t=1744372873\" width=620 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930340/extras/709e3f907fe551a3a9ca6d07f16c0459.webm?t=1744372873\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930340/extras/709e3f907fe551a3a9ca6d07f16c0459.mp4?t=1744372873\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ATMOSPHERIC ADVENTURE</strong><i>\u00a0through a single-player campaign spanning multiple chapters each containing dozens of unique hand-crafted levels.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930340/extras/177364db969e59da3e2c7485a6ddee08.avif?t=1744372873\" data-has-big width=800 height=140 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VOICE ACTED </strong>main character provides\u00a0<i>dynamic spoken dialog</i>\u00a0commenting on player actions and gameplay events.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BANDITS are also<strong> voice acted -</strong>\u00a0providing a more <i><u>personal connection</u></i>\u00a0as you battle your enemies.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DANGEROUS ENVIROMENTAL HAZARDS</strong>\u00a0are found around every corner inside a cursed gold mine that is trying to protect its gold by actively attempting to kill you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Light a torch. Grab your shotgun. Steal a map from a murderous gang of bandits and escape into darkness in this single-player FPS. Battle against dangerous critters, cursed enemies and elude the hazards lurking in the depths of a cursed gold mine seeking to protect its treasures.",
